  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Tuesday 17 November 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nA Rare Opportunity to Create Something Truly Special\r\n\r\nEvery great home starts with a vision, and this original family home at 1/41 Deep Creek Road, Torbay, is ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\nBrimming with potential and offering a fabulous blank canvas, this is your opportunity to roll up your sleeves, unleash your creativity and transform a much-loved family home into something extraordinary. Whether you dream of a complete renovation, a modern makeover or reimagining the layout to suit your family's needs, the possibilities here are exciting.\r\n\r\nThe flexible floor plan offers scope for a variety of living arrangements, making it an appealing proposition for extended families or those looking to create a home that grows with them. Yes, this property needs considerable love, work and vision, but for the right buyer, the rewards could be well worth the effort.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen has been removed, but there's no need to put everything on hold. A replacement kitchen is already waiting in the garage, ready for installation and immediate use, giving you a head start while you plan the finishing touches and create a home that truly reflects your style.\r\n\r\nAnd the location! It's a winner! Directly across from Torbay Primary School, with sea views, generous parking and the ever-popular Waiake Beach just a leisurely stroll away, this is a fabulous position to put down roots and make the most of the East Coast Bays lifestyle.\r\n\r\nCherished by its owners as a family home, this property is ready for someone new to see beyond what is and imagine what could be.\r\n\r\nBring your ideas, your tool belt and your imagination. The potential is here, the location is superb, and the opportunity is yours to make it something special.\r\n\r\nDream big. Roll up your sleeves. Create the home you've always wanted!",
